\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces One-time compilation cost and composite metric score by model configuration. Costs for the confirmed configuration are \textbf  {actual Anthropic API billing} from the 66-trial MIPROv2 run (19.3M input + 3.0M output Sonnet\nobreakspace  {}4.6 tokens at \$3/\$15 per million). After compilation, \emph  {deployed inference cost is \$0 when running on a local model (e.g.\ GPT-OSS-120 BF16 via Ollama)}. The full two-day R\&D session (compilation, baseline, dev and test evaluation) totaled \$200 in API costs. \textsuperscript  {*}Legacy costs were early estimates, not verified from billing.}}{26}{table.5}\protected@file@percent }
